  delete_widget:
    kind: destroy
    repeatability: repeatable
    deadline: 30s
    input:
      type: object
      properties:
        id: {type: string}
    http: {method: DELETE, host: "{from-target}", path: "/widgets/{id}"}

CAPABILITIES       http
BOUND              mandatory
REPEATABILITY      repeatable
DEADLINE           30s
CONCURRENCY LIMIT  1
